WEBVTT

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.160
<b>First Semester Closing Ceremony</b>

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.810
Summer break's finally here, huh?

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:28.290
S-S-Summer... Summer, summer, 
summer, summer, summer!

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:35.510
Summer, summer, summer,
summer, summer, summer!

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.910
What the heck?

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.190
Well...

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.780
Calm down a little, Tattsun.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.510
You're too excited for summer break!

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.310
How will you all spend your time 
in this midsummer weather?!

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.810
This is the season of bright skies!

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:45.390
You've all displayed high spirits

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.860
that never give in to rain or summer heat!

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.280
Thank you!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:53.160
If the cry of cicadas can permeate rocks,

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:57.460
surely, your voices have come 
to permeate this building, as well.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.870
What youthful experiences will you have
this summer? What will you see?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.970
What will you learn? 
What will you accomplish? Bam!

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.700
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.170
I look forward to seeing you 
all again next semester!

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.460
Now, everyone...

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:14.970
Your summer break starts now! 
So get going, play, and rest!

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:48.540
It's here, it's here, it's here!

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:49.470
At last, it's here!

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:50.690
All you've said is "It's here."

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.000
Th-Th-The beach! Beach! Beach!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.090
Don't get ahead of yourself, Tattsun! 
Save that line for later!

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.570
There's a right timing?

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.510
Of course!

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.460
A-All right!

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.080
One, two...

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.560
It's the beach!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:05.560
The beach.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.260
We want to try doing that!

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:10.290
That was a fantasy?!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.250
No, no, it's a vision of the future.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:15.400
<b>Episode 1 
It's Like Looking in a Mirror, and I Don't Like It</b>

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.850
Isn't that why we're all here to buy swimsuits?

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:17.630
After all, our summer break just started!

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:22.040
But is it really all right to choose 
whichever we want, Miyucchi?

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:25.350
Yes, Luvia-san said this is 
her present to everyone.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.770
But that's a lot of money...

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.910
She said that, using this, we could 
buy out the whole store.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.320
What's that rainbow-glowing card?

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.360
We don't need to buy the whole store!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:39.470
Man, I'm so glad I'm friends with Miyu-sama.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.950
Please be our friend forever!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.320
Stop that! There's no way this scene
could be called "friendship"!

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:48.820
I don't recall ever becoming your friend.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.160
You say that with no doubt in your eyes?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.160
What's wrong, Kuro-chan?

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.750
Huh? What do you mean?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.270
You've seemed a little down all day.

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:02.950
That's not true!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.020
Go on. You choose a swimsuit, too, Mimi.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.050
No!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.190
No way, no way, no way!

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.140
There's no way I can wear that!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.910
Come on, just try it on.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:15.350
It might suit you better than you think.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.480
It will not!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.410
The swimsuits I'm familiar with 
aren't shaped like a "V"!

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:22.880
Don't worry, don't worry. It won't hurt at all.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.320
What's that camera for?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.670
Illya-cha—

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.240
I'll buy this one.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.960
Tatsuko-chan?!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.610
Oh, no! We only took our 
eyes off her for a second!

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.750
Someone stop that exhibitionist!

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.680
What are you guys doing?!

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.250
Shut up, you walking public obscenity!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.240
Let's go.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.690
I see! You're all too charmed by my looks!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.420
Ladies, we're terribly sorry!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.180
Shut up! You're being creepy!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.820
Hey! You shouldn't say that to a friend!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.300
Let go!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.430
Ladies?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.260
Let's behave and choose our swimsuits quietly.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:05:00.170
Yeah. Creating a public fuss isn't good.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.400
We're old enough to know better.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:06.820
My, that light blue top is very cute!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.580
It's very tasteful, isn't it? 
But I worry about the lack of frills.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:15.250
Then why not pair it with this denim one?

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:22.210
Why are you all talking weird now?

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.660
That's rude, calling it "weird."

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.680
This is how a proper lady speaks, Tatsuko-san.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:32.820
No one talks all creepy like that!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:39.310
So, as for the eighth Card...

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.290
Have you determined its location?

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.310
Yes.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:46.640
Given where it's located, I haven't 
been able to confirm it directly.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:48.660
But I'm certain it's here.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.210
Under the sea...

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.040
That's a troublesome spot.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.670
Yeah.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:00.030
I can't believe there are eight Cards, 
when we thought there were seven.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:02.170
We can't afford to leave it, can we?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.170
Naturally. Auguste?

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:09.130
Understood. I'll have everything prepared 
within the next twelve hours.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.840
Good grief.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.860
This is going to be a rough summer.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.650
Kuro-chan, are you sure you're okay?

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.260
You look like you're in pain.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.900
Looks like I'm not okay.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.630
Huh?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:24.470
Kuro-chan?

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:25.330
Illya, come here!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:29.920
What is it? We're in the middle 
of choosing swimsuits!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:31.660
That doesn't matter right now!

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.120
I'm almost out of mana.

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.220
You're almost out?

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.600
Uh, so you mean...

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.500
Please top me off.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:45.960
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.190
What's wrong, Illy-Kuro-san?

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:50.640
Huh? Oh, uh...

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:54.990
Flowers! Kuro and I need to go pick some flowers!

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.710
Ah, excuse me, then.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:58.650
L-Let's go, Kuro.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:01.860
What do they mean by "pick flowers"?

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.660
It's a euphemism for going to pee, Tatsuko-san.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:08.490
It seems like they're more likely to 
fertilize flowers than pick them...

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.820
This feels like a most unladylike conversation.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:22.290
Hey, if you're going to do it, then hurry.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.040
<i>Wait.</i>

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:26.290
<i>What's with this mood?</i>

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.510
<i>Why is Kuro acting so meek?!</i>

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.560
<i>No, no, no!</i>

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.080
<i>I can't do it like this!</i>

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.940
K-Kuro, you can start.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:40.440
That's how you always did it, right?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.850
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.520
<i>I think I made the wrong move.</i>

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.580
<i>The mood's getting even stranger...</i>

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.310
<i>Isn't this turning into </i>that<i> kind of mood?</i>

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.240
<i>Th-This... This is...</i>

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:58.030
<i>Anyone watching us right now could 
only think that's what's going on!</i>

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:02.040
<i>Illya-chan and Kuro-chan 
were that way together?!</i>

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.630
Wh-Why does it have to be a kiss, anyway?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:10.460
There are other ways, but you 
would never agree to those.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.340
So there are others? What are they?

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.800
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:22.550
Well... You and I would... with our... and then...

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.360
P-Pervert! Pervert, pervert, pervert!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.880
Told you so.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.650
That's dirty!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.100
Dirty? I wish you'd stop acting so pure.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:40.870
Even you must have had the thought, 
"I wonder if I'll do that one day, too," right?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.640
Stop it! I don't want to think 
of doing that with you!

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:49.800
Please don't continue this topic any further!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.800
Are you finished?

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:55.810
For one thing...

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:57.220
You're still resisting?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:01.930
Even if you need that, 
there's no reason it has to be me!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.770
Jeez.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.440
True, I could do it with other people, but...

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.690
<i>She'd do it with others, too?!</i>

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:13.600
But for whatever reason, it's far more 
effective when I do it with you.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:16.410
I get about ten times more with you than others.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:20.330
So if you won't do it for me,

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:24.660
then I'll go around kissing whoever I can find.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.120
What?!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.120
Huh?!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.710
What are you saying?!

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.860
Well, I don't want to do it with 
complete strangers, either.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.460
So I'll start with people we know.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.470
Oh! Maybe I could get Onii-chan to give me lots!

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.470
No!

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:43.810
See? So for both our sakes, 
you just have to bear it.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.090
All right...

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:50.530
<i>Whoa... No way. 
They're really going to do it?</i>

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.530
Then, here I go.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.690
Lily blossoms.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.430
It's summer, all right.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:16.750
<i>I-It's deep!</i>

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:25.460
<i>Kuro-chan said that kissing 
was like a greeting for her,</i>

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:29.190
<i>but that's definitely not on the same level!</i>

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.150
W-Wait... Time out...

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.150
Th-That's enough, isn't it?

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.200
No. It's not nearly enough.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.490
Give me more of your saliva....

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.050
<i>Saliva?!</i>

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.550
K-Kuro...

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.410
What?

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:54.740
I-I'm at my limit... Let me rest a bit.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.960
You're pathetic.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:02.510
Well, this is rough on the one getting drained...

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:06.350
Is it? Then I'll gather the rest from Miyu.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.930
What?!

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.870
You just said it wasn't as good 
coming from anyone else!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:12.520
She's special.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:16.780
Not as effective as you, but I'm far more 
compatible with her than with others.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:17.570
Why?

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.850
Ask that all you want, but I don't know why!

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.790
It must be something to do with 
Miyu's birth or constitution...

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.540
Kuro?

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.120
Never mind.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:31.010
Anyway, what should I do, I wonder?

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.520
I'll do it!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.500
Just don't go to Miyu!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.870
<i>I-Illya-chan has such an 
incredible relationship with her.</i>

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:43.970
<i>She's desperately trying to stop 
Kuro-chan from going to Miyu-chan!</i>

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.130
<i>B-But that's surprising.</i>

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:48.290
<i>I thought Illya-chan was...</i>

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:48.930
Peeping?

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:52.900
Miyu-chan?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.800
Please don't get in their way.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.980
And forget everything you've seen here.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.070
<i>But how can I forget this?!</i>

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.120
M-Miyu-chan, you're okay with it?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.960
With Illya-chan and Kuro-chan doing those things?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:15.310
Oh, no... I didn't mean to say it's wrong 
for girls to do that with each other.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:22.960
I actually think it's fine, but I thought the 
two of you were like that, Miyu-chan...

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.250
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.720
Well... I mean...

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:31.950
You're okay with Illya-chan kissing others?

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:35.230
I didn't permit Kuro to do it unconditionally.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:40.570
But I don't intend to interfere, 
as long as she doesn't make a scene.

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:44.850
In the end, it's something Illya has to decide.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:48.620
Also, she only does that because she needs to.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.410
It's not my place to say anything.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.500
<i>How mature!</i>

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.810
<i>How can all this be?</i>

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.840
<i>I never imagined the three of them were 
in such a deep, complicated relationship!</i>

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:06.470
<i>I give up. This isn't something 
I can do anything about.</i>

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:13.000
<i>All I can do is to use this experience, 
and jot it down in a novel!</i>

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:13.710
By the way...

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.190
Huh? O-Oh, yes? What is it?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.440
How do you know our names?

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:22.440
Who are you?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:25.200
Someone from school?

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:28.330
You still don't remember me?!

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:40.380
Well, I'm certainly glad you managed 
to get your swimsuit safely!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.710
Oh, Ruby?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.850
Miyu-sama, did you find one you liked?

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:45.590
Yeah.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.520
Now we won't have to wear our school 
swimsuits at the beach tomorrow!

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.880
I wouldn't have minded that.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:56.270
No, that wouldn't be right at the beach.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.830
More importantly, are you sure?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.150
Huh? About what?

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:03.530
Is it really all right for me to 
stay at your house tonight?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.190
Yeah! Of course!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.490
You couldn't relax in a hotel room, right?

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.450
But won't I be a burden?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.470
It'll be fine!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:16.440
It's no problem. Mama asked 
you to stay over, too.

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:17.940
Besides...

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.920
There's no way you could sleep there, right?

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:27.170
Well, we did pretty well fighting that thing off, 
only losing half our Cards and a building.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.270
Agreed.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:32.820
I feel bad for Luvia-san, but you're probably right.

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:37.380
Now, now, stop looking so 
serious and come on inside.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.900
Our summer break just started, after all!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.680
That's right.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:45.430
You can just leave thinking about the 
troublesome things to the other two.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.110
Right, Illya-san?

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.270
Yeah.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.570
Let's go, Miyu.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:52.800
Okay.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.990
We're home!

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.580
Welcome home!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.670
P-Pardon my intrusion...

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:04.040
Please come inside, Miyu-san.

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.330
Hey, welcome.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.160
Miyu-chan, I'm so glad you're here.

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.680
Welcome, welcome.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.390
Th-Thank you for having me.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.780
I heard your boiler exploded?

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:19.580
The whole mansion was flattened.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.020
It would've been a shock to see.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:23.770
Sounds like it was really rough.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.400
No...

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.610
If you're ever in trouble, just let us know.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.500
We'll help you out.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.760
Thank you very much...

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.450
Onii-chan!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.470
Don't you touch Miyu, okay?

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.410
Huh?!

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.800
Wow, what a feast.

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:47.550
It looks so nice and lavish.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.090
You made all this, Onii-chan?

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.230
Yeah. Along with Sella.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:55.950
This is normally a job I do alone, though.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.700
Well, every now and then can't hurt, right?

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.350
No! You said that last time you made breakfast!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.980
Thanks for the meal!

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.470
I only made basic stuff that time!

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:04.490
Oh, um...

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:06.780
Basics are more than enough! Besides, this early—

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.320
Thank you.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:09.300
Okay, Sella, I get it. Let's just sit down and eat.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.650
It's good!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.540
That's our Onii-chan!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.050
Thanks. It's a pre-celebration 
for your birthdays tomorrow.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.530
I put a lot of effort into making it.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:20.660
Will you really be all right tomorrow?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.750
Perhaps I should go with you, after all.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.140
Sella, we had this discussion yesterday, too.

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:29.090
Tomorrow, we're going out 
to play by ourselves.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.600
But...

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.580
It'll be fine, Sella.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:36.860
I'll also be with them, 
and Issei will be coming to help.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:37.900
Issei?

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.390
Remember? The heir to Ryuudou Temple.

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:42.920
My, my, is that really okay?

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:45.980
You would've had a harem to yourself! Right?

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.410
Harem?

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:50.820
How could you say that about my 
little sister and her friends?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.930
That's mean!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:56.320
And after I bought a cute swimsuit 
that I wanted to show off to you!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.440
Oh, well... I <i>am</i> looking forward to that...

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:03.470
You are? Did you just say you're looking forward 
to seeing your little sister in a swimsuit?!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.750
N-Not like that! I only meant it as a brother.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:11.100
My, so you see Miyu-chan and 
the other girls differently, then?

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:12.090
Lolicon.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:15.590
Onii-chan... Seriously, don't touch Miyu, okay?

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.160
You've got it all wrong!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.810
Miyu-chan, are you all right?

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.560
Huh? Was there something you didn't like?

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:25.510
Oh, no... It's good.

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:26.840
Plus,

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:30.340
it has a bit of a nostalgic flavor.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.940
I see. That's good, then.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.030
<i>Nostalgic?</i>

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:39.700
By the way, Miyu-chan, did you bring your pajamas?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.050
Were your clothes destroyed with the house?

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:45.920
If so, you could borrow some of Illya-san's.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.050
It's fine.

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:49.880
Luvia-san already prepared new ones for me.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.790
New ones? That's nice!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.820
What kind?

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:56.930
I haven't seen them yet, either, so I don't know.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.940
I hope they're cute!

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:03.060
Aww... I hope they're sexy, see-through ones!

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.060
See-through?

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.890
Kuro, you're too lacking in shame!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.270
She'll be wearing underwear, so who 
cares if they're a little see-through?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.360
Right, Miyu?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.190
Huh? Uh, I...

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:16.860
At times like this, being the only 
man makes me want to run away.

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.650
Does it excite you?

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:20.230
Please cut that out...

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.870
Phew, that was a great bath!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.680
Since you kept going crazy, 
I couldn't relax very much.

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:30.500
I'm beat.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.440
After investigating,

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:36.970
I've learned that I'm the most 
developed out of all of us!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.210
Huh?!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.430
I wonder if the fact that I think about whether
I can show something off to others helps.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:48.700
Hmph. Others probably think you just look easy!

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:53.440
Illya, you're such a child. 
This is what they call "sexy."

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.350
Don't you agree, Miyu?

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.940
I don't particularly care about that.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:05.580
<i>Continuing, here's our leader 
of the Quiz Corner!</i>

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.370
<i>Who's today's challenger?</i>

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.370
Onii-chan!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.070
Hmm? What is it, Ku—

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:14.040
Well, what do you think? Is it sexy?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.900
What are you doing?!

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.690
You promised you'd only 
wear it back to our room!

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:19.650
Aww...

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:22.950
Sorry for the commotion.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:26.970
Excited?

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:29.920
You'd better not go after them 
while they're sleeping.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.230
I wouldn't do that!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.780
Hey, Mama?

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:42.240
What is it, Illya-chan?

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:45.960
Is it really necessary for all 
four of us to sleep together?!

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:51.060
Since Miyu-chan's staying over, 
having everyone together is better, isn't it?

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:53.820
That doesn't mean we also need you, Mama.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.210
It's cramped and hot.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:58.580
But night is the perfect time for girl talk.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:01.160
Like listing the guys you like in class, by rank—

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:04.930
It's time for kids to be asleep! 
Let's go to sleep! Quickly!

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:06.810
I love Onii-chan!

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:07.890
You do, too, right?

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:08.560
Huh?

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:12.150
My, then all three of you 
love Shirou, don't you?

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:15.290
Wh-Wh-What are you saying, Mama?

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.650
Onii-chan's quite sinful, too,

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.540
being loved by three elementary schoolers.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:24.210
Th-Th-That's not true! I'm not like that...

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:25.830
That's not just sinful.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.960
It sounds like it could lead to an actual crime.

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:30.940
Um, Illya... It's loud in there.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.860
I'll have to restrict Shirou.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.620
Listen to me!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.040
Hey, I'm coming in.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.130
Y-You're going to restrict Shirou-san?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.130
Illya, you have to get up early tomorrow—

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.420
Maybe castrate instead of restrict?

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:41.420
C-Castra— Huh? Castrate Shirou-san?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.350
Just cut it off before Shirou causes trouble.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:48.100
I'd still love him, even if he's castrated.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.780
That's true love!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:52.730
What are you all talking about?!

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:55.150
Onii-chan!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.810
Sh-Shirou-san?

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:00.400
My, my, you're coming into 
a room full of women?

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.030
Maybe I really will need to castrate you.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.360
Onii-chan, did you want to sleep with us?

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:09.870
Th-That's not it! I was just worried 
because you're being so loud.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:13.370
Let me guess, you got turned on by 
seeing me in my negligee earlier?

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:17.030
O-Of course he didn't! Right, Onii-chan?

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:18.660
Then you're after Miyu-chan?

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.400
What is it?

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:22.090
Ah, jeez! Just go to sleep already!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.130
This is nice!

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.100
Hey, Nee-san!

00:22:56.860 --> 00:22:59.580
Does everyone have everything?

00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:00.360
Yes.

00:23:00.360 --> 00:23:01.740
We're good!

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:03.190
You worry too much, Sella.

00:23:03.550 --> 00:23:05.380
Off you go, then. Be careful.

00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:06.560
See you.

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:07.580
Yeah!

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.560
Sorry for the wait, Onii-chan!

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:11.570
Yeah.

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:17.000
Now, then... Off to the beach!

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:18.010
Yeah!

00:23:18.010 --> 00:23:19.490
We'll be off.

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:22.890
Take that!

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:24.020
You've done it now!

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:25.110
It's cold...

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:27.440
Here's your payback!

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:29.880
It's cold.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:31.260
Shero!

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:36.520
<b>Tricolore Birthday</b>

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:34.640
I am Ryuudou Issei.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:35.870
Oh, ho?
